<title>USA: USDA adds commodity to Russia, East Europe GSM-102.</title>
<headline>USDA adds commodity to Russia, East Europe GSM-102.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Tuesday said it has added nutritional beverage preparations to the commodities available to Russia and Eastern Europe under the Export Credit Guarantee Program (GSM-102).</p>
<p>USDA said the total fiscal year 1997 dollar allocations for sales to Croatia, Czech Republic, Estonia, Latvia, Lithuania, Poland, Slovakia, Slovenia and Russia under GSM-102 are unchanged.</p>
</text>
